  _lines:
  - _characterName: Lucas
    _characterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 68628838cd9f9ad4c870c69acd786368, type: 3}
    _content: "\u0110\u1EEBng l\xE0m phi\u1EC1n t\xF4i, t\xF4i \u0111ang d\u1EDF
      tay v\u1EBD b\u1EE9c tranh n\xE0y."
  - _characterName: Lucas
    _characterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 68628838cd9f9ad4c870c69acd786368, type: 3}
    _content: "T\xF4i ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 kh\xE1ch tr\u1ECD \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y v\xE0i
      ng\xE0y, v\u1EE5 tr\u1ED9m \u0111\xF3 kh\xF4ng li\xEAn quan g\xEC \u0111\u1EBFn
      t\xF4i."
